## Codec note

The browser-based video player in your TV decides what plays:
- **MP4 (H.264)** — plays on everything ✅
- **WebM (VP8/VP9)** — plays on most Android TVs ✅
- **MKV** — ExoPlayer can decode these if the codec is supported by the device ✅ (usually works)
- **AVI / WMV** — may not work depending on codec inside

